        requirements = nil,
        walkthrough = '1. Head to Lower Delkfutt\'s Tower in Qufim Island for a cutscene and the beginning of Chapter 1.\n2. Zone into Upper Jeuno for another cutscene.\n3. Go to the Infirmary in Upper Jeuno (G-10) next to the upstairs auction house npc\'s and Home Point #3 then speak with Monberaux.\n4. After the cutscene, you will receive the [Key Item] Mysterious amulet.',
