        walkthrough = '1. Icarus Wing\n2. Echo Drops\n3. MP and HP regen drinks\n4. Travel to Sealion\'s Den and click the Iron Gate for a cutscene.\n5. When your party is ready, click the Iron Gate and enter the battlefield "The Warrior\'s Path".\n   - Although this mission is uncapped, your buffs will still wear off when entering so make sure to buff inside.\n   - It should also be noted that once you enter this battle, you cannot leave until you either win or lose.',
